Moving the payload position $Y$ changes the mass distribution of the gantry and therefore its inertia matrix $M(Y)$.
This position dependence is included by representing the baseline in linear parameter-varying (LPV) form, with the measured payload position \(Y\) as scheduling variable \cite{toth2010modeling}.
